+---
+id: task-001-implement-json-pointer-resolution
+type: task
+title: "Implement JSON Pointer resolution"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement RFC 6901 JSON Pointer resolution for this package.
+
+The public API must export `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` from `src/index.ts`. It accepts a
+JSON document and pointer string, returns the referenced value, and throws when the pointer is
+syntactically invalid or cannot resolve within the supplied document. Add focused automated tests,
+including RFC escaping and object/array traversal, so later JSON features can rely on the behavior.
